flowchart LR
    P[Order Producer] -->|Unary gRPC / HTTP2| LB[Client endpoint pool<br/>round-robin]
    LB --> A[Broker A :50051]
    LB --> B[Broker B :50052]

    subgraph Runtime[Executori separati in fiecare broker A/B]
        RPC[RPC executor<br/>Publish / Ack / Nack / Health]
        N[SubscriptionNotifier]
        SUB[Subscription executor elastic<br/>workeri Subscribe]
        RPC -->|notifica schimbari| N
        N -->|trezeste workerii| SUB
    end

    A --> RPC
    B --> RPC
    A --> SUB
    B --> SUB
    RPC -->|persistenta| DB[(SQLite WAL<br/>messages / subscriptions / deliveries / DLQ)]
    SUB -->|citeste / actualizeaza livrari<br/>fallback crossNodeRefreshMs| DB
    SUB -->|Broker: server-streaming Subscribe| C[Inventory / Audit consumers<br/>reconnect si failover A/B]
    C -->|ACK/NACK unary catre broker A/B| RPC
    C --> LOCAL[(SQLite local per consumer<br/>efect + deduplicare)]
